                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6e2f8364-a93e-3960-bb27-a1ed4c23b6a4",
                        "entry_id": "daf905a2-f59c-394c-92e9-1c1c87a51ed6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An isomer of a benzene derivative having two substituents adjacent on the ring."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "c0d36c63-e677-45ff-b2fb-d13fecd566a4",
                                "sense_id": "6e2f8364-a93e-3960-bb27-a1ed4c23b6a4",
                                "text": "When the cinnamic acid had been nitrated the ortho was separated from the para, by suspending in alcohol and leading hydrochloric acid gas into the mixture : […]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9e91d2d9-d171-403a-86e7-98578b6ef609",
                                "sense_id": "6e2f8364-a93e-3960-bb27-a1ed4c23b6a4",
                                "text": "Similarly, it also does not make sense to call the spin states of ortho and para hydrogen entangled."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3a38ba7b-7271-35a5-b0b4-64e303f7ec9f",
                        "entry_id": "daf905a2-f59c-394c-92e9-1c1c87a51ed6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A certain type of flat eyepiece."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "28325e50-1dd5-43b9-a4c2-731d6b7b7905",
                                "sense_id": "3a38ba7b-7271-35a5-b0b4-64e303f7ec9f",
                                "text": "Orthos are excellent eyepieces, still preferred by some backyard astronomers for medium- and high-power applications, especially planetary observing."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f4cb92a3-68b1-3718-806f-9ea39229a76f",
                        "entry_id": "daf905a2-f59c-394c-92e9-1c1c87a51ed6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An orthochromatic plate."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "countable",
                            "dated"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a85a7cde-27e2-43bc-8c83-c77a56957dba",
                                "sense_id": "f4cb92a3-68b1-3718-806f-9ea39229a76f",
                                "text": "Wherever the exposure is likely to be cut short— and this includes all high speed work and most portraiture — the ortho is not so suitable as the ordinary plate."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a530582e-8a1d-34a8-af52-ffbeaee5b9dd",
                        "entry_id": "daf905a2-f59c-394c-92e9-1c1c87a51ed6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Clipping of orthography."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "clipping",
                            "countable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "570d7eb7-6dee-3adf-9e25-b002c00ef7a8",
                        "entry_id": "daf905a2-f59c-394c-92e9-1c1c87a51ed6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Clipping of orthophoto."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "clipping",
                            "countable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d293ddec-d1d2-46bd-a20e-cbb6e5d68ec8",
                                "sense_id": "570d7eb7-6dee-3adf-9e25-b002c00ef7a8",
                                "text": "The typical orthophoto building process is a long one, however, and the photography that the orthos are based may be several years old before an orthophoto is ready for distribution."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
